msgid "libopenshot-audio (Build Instructions)"
msgstr "libopenshot-audio (Instruksi Build)"

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../developers.rst:163
msgid ""
"This library is required for audio playback and audio effects. It is based "
"on the JUCE audio framework. Here are the commands to build it:"
msgstr ""
"Perpustakaan ini diperlukan untuk pemutaran audio dan efek audio. Ini "
"berbasis pada kerangka kerja audio JUCE. Berikut adalah perintah untuk "
"membangunnya:"

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../developers.rst:176
msgid ""
"Essentially, we are switching to the ``libopenshot-audio/build`` folder, "
"then running ``cmake ..`` on the parent folder. This finds dependencies and "
"creates all the needed Makefiles used to compile this library. Then ``make``"
" uses those Makefiles to compile this library, and ``make install`` installs"
" them in the location we specified. If ``CMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX`` isn't set, "
"the files will install to ``/usr/local/`` (by default) and ``make install`` "
"will require administrative privileges to run."
msgstr ""
"Pada dasarnya, kita beralih ke folder ``libopenshot-audio/build``, lalu "
"menjalankan ``cmake ..`` pada folder induk. Ini mencari dependensi dan "
"membuat semua Makefile yang diperlukan untuk mengompilasi perpustakaan ini. "
"Kemudian ``make`` menggunakan Makefile tersebut untuk mengompilasi "
"perpustakaan ini, dan ``make install`` menginstalnya di lokasi yang kita "
"tentukan. Jika ``CMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX`` tidak disetel, file akan diinstal ke"
" ``/usr/local/`` (secara default) dan ``make install`` memerlukan hak "
"administratif untuk dijalankan."

