#: ../developers.rst:239
msgid "Command-Line Options"
msgstr "Opsi Baris Perintah"

#: ../developers.rst:241
msgid ""
"These options work with the installed OpenShot application, including "
"``openshot-qt.exe`` on Windows. When running from source, use ``python3 "
"src/launch.py`` in place of the application name. Put options before any "
"file paths you want OpenShot to open."
msgstr ""
"Opsi ini bekerja dengan aplikasi OpenShot yang terpasang, termasuk "
"``openshot-qt.exe`` di Windows. Saat menjalankan dari sumber, gunakan "
"``python3 src/launch.py`` menggantikan nama aplikasi. Letakkan opsi sebelum "
"jalur file apa pun yang ingin Anda buka dengan OpenShot."

#: ../developers.rst:246
msgid "OpenShot command-line options"
msgstr "Opsi baris perintah OpenShot"

#: ../developers.rst:250
msgid "Option"
msgstr "Opsi"

#: ../developers.rst:251
msgid "What it does"
msgstr "Fungsinya"

#: ../developers.rst:252
msgid "``-h``, ``--help``"
msgstr "``-h``, ``--help``"

#: ../developers.rst:253
msgid "Show the available options and exit."
msgstr "Tampilkan opsi yang tersedia dan keluar."

#: ../developers.rst:254
msgid "``-V``, ``--version``"
msgstr "``-V``, ``--version``"

#: ../developers.rst:255
msgid "Print the OpenShot version and exit."
msgstr "Tampilkan versi OpenShot dan keluar."

#: ../developers.rst:256
msgid "``-l CODE``, ``--lang CODE``"
msgstr "``-l CODE``, ``--lang CODE``"

#: ../developers.rst:257
msgid ""
"Use the chosen interface language for this launch. The code must be one of "
"those shown by ``--list-languages``."
msgstr ""
"Gunakan bahasa antarmuka yang dipilih untuk peluncuran ini. Kode harus salah"
" satu yang ditampilkan oleh ``--list-languages``."

#: ../developers.rst:259
msgid "``--list-languages``"
msgstr "``--list-languages``"

#: ../developers.rst:260
msgid "List supported language codes and exit."
msgstr "Daftar kode bahasa yang didukung dan keluar."

#: ../developers.rst:261
msgid "``--path FOLDER``"
msgstr "``--path FOLDER``"

#: ../developers.rst:262
msgid ""
"Add a folder to the Python module search path. You can repeat this option to"
" add more than one folder."
msgstr ""
"Tambahkan folder ke jalur pencarian modul Python. Anda dapat mengulangi opsi"
" ini untuk menambahkan lebih dari satu folder."

#: ../developers.rst:264
msgid "``--feedback-preview``"
msgstr "``--feedback-preview``"

#: ../developers.rst:265
msgid ""
"Show the feedback notice on launch without marking the invitation as shown "
"in saved settings."
msgstr ""
"Tampilkan pemberitahuan umpan balik saat peluncuran tanpa menandai undangan "
"sebagai sudah ditampilkan dalam pengaturan yang disimpan."

#: ../developers.rst:267
msgid "``--update-preview``"
msgstr "``--update-preview``"

#: ../developers.rst:268
msgid ""
"Show the update notice on launch. Both preview options can be used together."
msgstr ""
"Tampilkan pemberitahuan pembaruan saat peluncuran. Kedua opsi pratinjau "
"dapat digunakan bersama."

#: ../developers.rst:269
msgid "``--test-models``"
msgstr "``--test-models``"

#: ../developers.rst:270
msgid ""
"Enable Qt's data model tester for development (requires Qt 5.11 or later)."
msgstr ""
"Aktifkan penguji model data Qt untuk pengembangan (memerlukan Qt 5.11 atau "
"lebih baru)."

#: ../developers.rst:271
msgid "``-d``, ``--debug``, ``--debug-ui``"
msgstr "``-d``, ``--debug``, ``--debug-ui``"

#: ../developers.rst:272
msgid "Add detailed interface messages to its log file and the terminal."
msgstr "Tambahkan pesan antarmuka terperinci ke file log dan terminal."

#: ../developers.rst:273
msgid "``--debug-engine``"
msgstr "``--debug-engine``"

#: ../developers.rst:274
msgid ""
"Add detailed video and audio engine messages to its log file and the "
"terminal."
msgstr ""
"Tambahkan pesan mesin video dan audio terperinci ke file log dan terminal."

#: ../developers.rst:275
msgid "``--log-level LEVEL``"
msgstr "``--log-level LEVEL``"

#: ../developers.rst:276
msgid ""
"Set the logging level for both parts of OpenShot, in files and the terminal."
msgstr ""
"Atur tingkat pencatatan untuk kedua bagian OpenShot, di file dan terminal."

#: ../developers.rst:277
msgid "``--log-file-level LEVEL``"
msgstr "``--log-file-level LEVEL``"

#: ../developers.rst:278
msgid "Set the logging level in both log files."
msgstr "Atur tingkat pencatatan di kedua file log."

#: ../developers.rst:279
msgid "``--log-console-level LEVEL``"
msgstr "``--log-console-level LEVEL``"

#: ../developers.rst:280
msgid "Set the logging level in the terminal for both parts of OpenShot."
msgstr "Atur tingkat pencatatan di terminal untuk kedua bagian OpenShot."

#: ../developers.rst:281
msgid "``--debug-file``"
msgstr "``--debug-file``"

#: ../developers.rst:282
msgid ""
"Add detailed interface messages to its log file only. This older option is "
"accepted but is not shown by ``--help``."
msgstr ""
"Tambahkan pesan antarmuka terperinci hanya ke file log. Opsi lama ini "
"diterima tetapi tidak ditampilkan oleh ``--help``."

#: ../developers.rst:284
msgid "``--debug-console``"
msgstr "``--debug-console``"

#: ../developers.rst:285
msgid ""
"Add detailed interface messages to the terminal only. This older option is "
"accepted but is not shown by ``--help``."
msgstr ""
"Tambahkan pesan antarmuka terperinci hanya ke terminal. Opsi lama ini "
"diterima tetapi tidak ditampilkan oleh ``--help``."

#: ../developers.rst:287
msgid "``PROJECT.osp`` or media file paths"
msgstr "``PROJECT.osp`` atau jalur file media"

#: ../developers.rst:288
msgid ""
"Open a project when the first file path ends in ``.osp``. Otherwise, start a"
" new project and import the supplied media files."
msgstr ""
"Buka proyek ketika jalur file pertama berakhiran ``.osp``. Jika tidak, mulai"
" proyek baru dan impor file media yang disediakan."

#: ../developers.rst:291
msgid ""
"For ``LEVEL``, use ``debug``, ``info``, ``warning``, ``error``, "
"``critical``, or ``off``. See :ref:`logging_ref` for log file locations, "
"examples, and more about choosing logging options."
msgstr ""
"Untuk ``LEVEL``, gunakan ``debug``, ``info``, ``warning``, ``error``, "
"``critical``, atau ``off``. Lihat :ref:`logging_ref` untuk lokasi file log, "
"contoh, dan informasi lebih lanjut tentang memilih opsi pencatatan."

